  "title": "Kagaku Kyuujo-tai TechnoVoyager",
  "justification": "AniDB lists the 18 broadcast episodes in Japanese order (1982-04-17 to 1982-09-11) and the 6 unaired ones as specials S1-S6; TVDB season 1 lists all 24 in the English order. Each Japanese title pairs with one English episode by story (English Wikipedia's episode table gives the English title of each Japanese episode): 1 \"TB Hasshin! Chikyuu o Sukue!!\" is \"Shockwave\" (E11), 2 the Arles island rescue is \"Cloudburst\" (E14), 3 the space colony is \"Firefall\" (E1), 6 the forest fire is \"One of a Kind\" (E3), 9 the vanished lunar city is \"Computer Madness\" (E2), 12 the Alps disaster is \"Snowbound\" (E4), 18 the Niagara fight is \"Star Crusher\" (E10), and so on for all 24; TVDB's air dates on the 18 broadcast episodes equal AniDB's. The unaired S1-S6 are \"Crusader\" (E20), \"Metal Head\" (E13), \"Stardive\" (E21), \"U.F.O.\" (E24), \"Mind Meld\" (E16) and \"Trial\" (E22). By default episode k fell on episode k and the specials on a season 0 TVDB does not have.",
